>> Animal := Into entsha.
Animal xa-kufika: ['sound:'] yenza: { :s eyakho sound := s. }.
Animal xa-kufika: ['makeSound'] yenza: { Imveliso bhala: eyakho sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal entsha.
Cat xa-kufika: ['init'] yenza: { eyakho sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat xa-kufika: ['meow'] yenza: { ngokwakho makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
